  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "藏水bī"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>董蕙文</b></span></p><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī台灣獨獨無倚海ê縣市出世kah大漢ê我，逐家sian想to想無我thài ē興藏水bī--leh？厝邊頭尾便若聽著我koh去佗位tshit-thô，lóng giâu疑講我tsiah細粒子，空氣矸仔kám揹ē tín動？He一支就beh 20公斤--neh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">讀大學ê時，我tuè一寡仔研究團隊去做調查，看合歡山有啥mih蟲thuā、阿里山有偌濟塗龍，mā tī南仁山蹛一個月記錄樹身ê大細。我雄雄suah想beh知影海--裡生做啥款，就án-ne tsông去揣教授講beh研究珊瑚。伊講：「你先學ē-hiáu藏水tsiah-koh講。」Bī水tsiânn無簡單，ài先tī教室上課、去游泳池練習。拄開始揹鉛帶落去tám-tám，m̄知ē直直沉--落-去--無，熟手tsiah知吐khuì kah suh khuì ê mê角。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藏水bī ê裝備tsiânn濟，定著ài tshuân hōo tsiâu，檢查hōo好勢，有擋寒ê厚衫、hōo目睭ē-sái peh開ê水鏡、喘khuì用ê空氣矸仔kah調節器、泅水ê kap仔鞋，規軀穿穿--leh ná徛鵝行路幌來幌去。落去海--裡tsiah是挑戰，tsiânn實是進無步、退無路。藏水分做「船藏」kah「岸藏」。「船藏」khah輕可，坐船出海，到位就跳--落-去，藏煞舵公ē駛倚--來接阮起--去；「岸藏」就ài家己揹裝備tuì poh岸行--落-去，起--來腹肚iau koh加上水ê重量，tsiânn忝頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán若去生份ê所在bī水tio̍h揣gâu人tshuā路，平常時仔mā ài揣人做伴。水愈深壓力愈大，落--去ài沓沓仔來，耳仔kah鼻仔ê壓力若無tháu放，鼻血ē tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴。有一改教練就tī枋仔頂寫「鯊魚beh來--looh！」，我tshuah一tiô，原來伊是leh滾sńg笑講血ē kā鯊魚siânn倚--來。藏水tiānn-tiānn ài看氣賰偌濟，tī海--裡siunn深iah是siunn久就ài khuann-khuann仔出水面，若是siunn tshóng-pōng一下就起--去，身軀內ê空氣pho bē赴排掉，kā血管that--leh，ē有性命危險。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我頭擺藏水就tī火燒島，教授in去做珊瑚調查，我去海洋實習。Hit工風湧大，逐家lóng眩船，一下落船就緊去歇睏。我ná無事代，tī hit搭行行se̍h-se̍h--leh，看tsia起起落落ê海湧，kā tīng-khok-khok ê礁石刻做百百樣。身軀邊ê魚仔泅過來泅過去，珊瑚kah石奶ná花leh開，錢鰻bih tī礁空探頭，hia是保育區，bē-sái拍魚、掠魚，tsiah有tsiah-nī suí ê景緻。台灣四箍圍仔lóng是海，lán tio̍h-ài寶惜大自然，尊重kah lán鬥陣tī tsia生活ê萬物。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLt7DIpnVS6GlOksvNMxxZrCGD0y2XK2lI8abOCvPttxYzv3nGD3tQ4342rjE71t8P916-4uPTfyG9X3le1W37G5kYW_VP-KicdLe17MS7LJ4P6tKXyTfLpCSQ957Covz-pg1jvXcXA05fwANDGxdTMeulnPHyNhDIPFdwQ5HrzYBqUctl8N8olHxQaH4V/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_034_B.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLt7DIpnVS6GlOksvNMxxZrCGD0y2XK2lI8abOCvPttxYzv3nGD3tQ4342rjE71t8P916-4uPTfyG9X3le1W37G5kYW_VP-KicdLe17MS7LJ4P6tKXyTfLpCSQ957Covz-pg1jvXcXA05fwANDGxdTMeulnPHyNhDIPFdwQ5HrzYBqUctl8N8olHxQaH4V/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_034_B.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSWg0Ky_f5S8bHU23DE11nGOovuf0jKwygkyMBL6heb4P-bPKDBnq6cmCWer1uI_fPdnY1BGvZNR_3j077IKghcbQilY2ufQgzT6nnFP92eDvj6TRUVTHlI6kzuuK4f3xhska02ee96nXSOfYffnyFiNHhHASwhyrnnDoKf2-_J87A-yFeZsrHP8yBW3Cq/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_37.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjSWg0Ky_f5S8bHU23DE11nGOovuf0jKwygkyMBL6heb4P-bPKDBnq6cmCWer1uI_fPdnY1BGvZNR_3j077IKghcbQilY2ufQgzT6nnFP92eDvj6TRUVTHlI6kzuuK4f3xhska02ee96nXSOfYffnyFiNHhHASwhyrnnDoKf2-_J87A